; ── HenWen AudioSocket tap (2026-09-03) ────────────────────────────────────
; Low-latency Listen-audio capture: replaces MixMonitor's buffered file
; writer (which was found to add ~2s of latency in ~32KB/~2s stdio flush
; lumps) with a live tap that streams the node's RX audio out over a plain
; TCP socket in real time. res_audiosocket.so MUST load before
; app_audiosocket.so -- the app resolves ast_audiosocket_init from the res_
; module at load time and fails outright ("undefined symbol") if loaded
; first; app_chanspy.so is what actually captures the node channel's audio
; onto the tap leg (see extensions-custom.snippet) without disturbing the
; channel's own Rpt() execution. Remove this whole block (and restart
; Asterisk) to fully disable.
load = res_audiosocket.so
load = app_audiosocket.so
load = app_chanspy.so
; ── end HenWen AudioSocket tap ──────────────────────────────────────────────
